t his mission here his only  moment of real hesitation comes when he  thinks solo might be killed in the  carbonite freezing process this isn't  because he's worried the process is too  cruel instead his only concern is how  it'll impact his finances since jabba  the hutt would like solo to arrive alive  fett's inclination to put money over  people and his ability to keep a cool  head are both exemplified throughout his  mission in the empire strikes back  everyone loves grogu that little guy  formerly known to fans as baby yoda has  quickly become one of the most beloved  star wars characters of all time  stop touching things  in the process of spawning memes all  over the internet he's also helped put  the mandalorian on the map and only 14  episodes into the show's run audiences  have become totally captivated by grogo  which made him the perfect target to  emphasize the cold-hearted nature of  boba fett when fett first meets dinjarin  the lead character of the mandalorian  he's not there purely to shed more blood  that having emerged from the sarlacc pit  wants to get his mandalorian armor back  i don't want your armor  i want my armor to instill some leverage  into the scenario fett remarks that he's  got an ally fennec shand poised with a  sniper rifle nearby while jaron notes  that his armor would protect him from  any sniper blast that clarifies that  jaren wouldn't be shan's target instead  at fett's signal the sniper would shoot  and kill grosgu who's busy meditating so  that he can call out for any other jedi  in the galaxy by the time this episode  aired boba fett had existed in pop  culture for over four decades and his  ruthless reputation was well known but  by threatening to kill a beloved  character like grogu fett's cold-hearted  nature was taken to a whole other level  and established for a whole new  generation of star wars fans  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  star wars are coming soon subscribe